[size=5][b]Valheim HotKeys[/b][/size]

A Valheim mod to add configurable hotkeys for various actions.

[line]

[size=4][b]Features[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Toggle HUD[/b]: Quickly hide/show the in-game HUD (default [b]F3[/b]).
[*][b]Hotbar Slot Bindings[/b]: Assign custom keys to any of the 8 hotbar slots.
[*][b]Custom Item Bindings[/b]:
[list]
[*]Bind hotkeys to items by name (e.g., "Healing Mead", "Arrow"). This can be either the localized name or the internal item ID.
[*][b]Partial Matching[/b]: "Arrow" will match "Fire Arrow", "Wood Arrow", etc.
[*][b]Item Cycling[/b]: Press the hotkey multiple times to cycle through all items in your inventory that match the search name.
[*]Bindings fire while you are moving, so you can drink or swap ammo on the run.
[/list]
[/list]

[line]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]

[size=3][b]Nexus Mods / Vortex[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Install via Vortex Mod Manager.
[*]-or- Download the mod from the Files tab above, and follow the Manual Installation instructions below.
[/list]

[size=3][b]Thunderstore / r2modman (Recommended)[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Install via Thunderstore Mod Manager or r2modman.
[*]-or- Download the mod from [url=https://thunderstore.io/c/valheim/p/malafein/ValheimHotKeys/]Thunderstore[/url], and follow the Manual Installation instructions below.
[/list]

[size=3][b]Manual Installation[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://valheim.thunderstore.io/package/denikson/BepInExPack_Valheim/]BepInExPack Valheim[/url].
[*]Download the latest release of ValheimHotKeys from [url=https://github.com/malafein/ValheimHotKeys/releases]GitHub[/url].
[*]Extract the ValheimHotKeys.dll file into your Valheim install folder, under BepInEx\plugins.
[/list]

[quote][b]Compatibility:[/b] version 1.1.0 and later require Valheim 1.0 or newer. Use 1.0.0 for earlier game versions.[/quote]

[line]

[size=4][b]Configuration[/b][/size]

The com.malafein.valheimhotkeys.cfg file will be generated in your BepInEx/config folder after the first run.
There you can set the HUD toggle key, the eight hotbar slot bindings, and the eight custom item bindings.

[b]Recommendation:[/b] Use a configuration manager like [url=https://github.com/shudnal/ConfigurationManager]shudnal's Configuration Manager[/url] to easily edit bindings and settings in-game.

Mouse buttons may be bound, but only [b]Mouse0[/b] through [b]Mouse4[/b] — Valheim does not resolve higher mouse buttons.

[line]

